\begin{abstract}
We present a unified formalism for the Universal Subatomic Informational Architecture \&
Astrophysical Encryption Simulator (USIA-AES v1.0). The framework couples lattice QCD,
holographic gravity, and post-quantum CKKS homomorphic encryption into a single
constrained Hamiltonian system on $\mathrm{SU}(3)\times\mathrm{Diff}(4)$, quantized via
BRST cohomology and equipped with encrypted S-matrix elements for multi-messenger
astrophysical processes.
\end{abstract}

