The physical Hilbert space is the BRST cohomology
\begin{equation}
  \mathcal{H}_{\text{phys}}
  =
  \frac{\ker \mathbf{Q}_{\text{BRST}}}{\mathrm{im}\,\mathbf{Q}_{\text{BRST}}}.
\end{equation}

